      "side": 1,
      "message": "They will be ordered on a single module and on dependencies, but not on other arbitrary modules.  Modules will be parsed and caught up to the current mutator at the point they are first added as a dependency.  They also won\u0027t have a full list of variants, just the variants required by the modules that depend on them that have been parsed.",
