      "message": "Yes, I think Paul is correct. It\u0027s not enough to check for ctx.Host(), because it\u0027s not always an sdk variant is created (since the \"m.UseSdk() || m.SplitPerApiLevel()\" condition).\n\nAdding an alias from \"sdk\" to \"\" in that case would seem like the right thing to do, which I try here in PS5. However the alias does not let us depend on specific variants in later mutators. See one of many failing tests below - in this case I think the alias only works if we depend on the subvariant with \"version:\", but not \"version:latest\".\n\n  --- FAIL: TestUniqueHostSoname (0.05s)\n    cc_sdk_test.go:2550: Android.bp:2:3: dependency \"mylib\" of \"mysdk\" missing variant:\n          os:android,image:,arch:arm64_armv8-a,sdk:sdk,link:shared,version:latest\n        available variants:\n          os:linux_glibc,arch:x86_64 (alias to os:linux_glibc,arch:x86_64,link:shared)\n          os:linux_glibc,arch:x86_64,link:static\n          os:linux_glibc,arch:x86_64,link:shared\n          os:linux_glibc,arch:x86 (alias to os:linux_glibc,arch:x86,link:shared)\n          os:linux_glibc,arch:x86,link:static\n          os:linux_glibc,arch:x86,link:shared\n          os:windows,arch:x86_64 (alias to os:windows,arch:x86_64,link:shared)\n          os:windows,arch:x86_64,link:static\n          os:windows,arch:x86_64,link:shared\n          os:android,image:,arch:arm64_armv8-a (alias to os:android,image:,arch:arm64_armv8-a,sdk:,link:shared,version:)\n          os:android,image:,arch:arm64_armv8-a,sdk: (alias to os:android,image:,arch:arm64_armv8-a,sdk:,link:shared,version:)\n          os:android,image:,arch:arm64_armv8-a,sdk:,link:static\n          os:android,image:,arch:arm64_armv8-a,sdk:,link:shared (alias to os:android,image:,arch:arm64_armv8-a,sdk:,link:shared,version:)\n          os:android,image:,arch:arm64_armv8-a,sdk:,link:shared,version:\n          os:android,image:,arch:arm64_armv8-a,sdk:,link:shared,version:latest (alias to os:android,image:,arch:arm64_armv8-a,sdk:,link:shared,version:)\n          os:android,image:,arch:arm64_armv8-a,sdk:sdk (alias to os:android,image:,arch:arm64_armv8-a,sdk:,link:shared,version:)\n          os:android,image:,arch:arm_armv7-a-neon (alias to os:android,image:,arch:arm_armv7-a-neon,sdk:,link:shared,version:)\n          os:android,image:,arch:arm_armv7-a-neon,sdk: (alias to os:android,image:,arch:arm_armv7-a-neon,sdk:,link:shared,version:)\n          os:android,image:,arch:arm_armv7-a-neon,sdk:,link:static\n          os:android,image:,arch:arm_armv7-a-neon,sdk:,link:shared (alias to os:android,image:,arch:arm_armv7-a-neon,sdk:,link:shared,version:)\n          os:android,image:,arch:arm_armv7-a-neon,sdk:,link:shared,version:\n          os:android,image:,arch:arm_armv7-a-neon,sdk:,link:shared,version:latest (alias to os:android,image:,arch:arm_armv7-a-neon,sdk:,link:shared,version:)\n          os:android,image:,arch:arm_armv7-a-neon,sdk:sdk (alias to os:android,image:,arch:arm_armv7-a-neon,sdk:,link:shared,version:)",
