      "writtenOn": "2021-05-11T08:06:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I had a quick check and there appear to be quite a few modules that would need sdk_version: \"current\" adding (to both source and prebuilts).\n\nIt is difficult to know exactly how many since the build stops at the first error. Is there any way to force it to keep going and report all errors it finds in the DepsMutator?\n\nAdding the property would be just the first step the modules are not guaranteed to be able to build against the current sdk.\n\nI suspect that some of the lower level libraries may have issues with that.",
      "parentUuid": "967565a8_4789e7bf",
      "revId": "454fc0a52f94e335ef928d2694402b09fa4ba7aa",
